Changes made by uxlab:
- The 45 skills are consolidated into 11 domain skills plus a router skill. Each
  original SKILL.md is now a reference file under skills/<domain>/references/,
  and its original references/ folder sits beside it.
- Cross-references between skills are rewritten to the "domain/name" notation.
- Sumi branding, the .sumi/ design-memory folder and the /sumi: command
  namespace are renamed to uxlab, .uxlab/ and /uxlab:. The "sumi" command is
  now "help".
- scripts/capture.mjs (puppeteer-core) is replaced by scripts/capture.py and
  scripts/capture.sh, which drive browser-harness over raw CDP. The in-page
  JavaScript (consent dismissal, design DNA measurement) is unchanged.

